# NOTE: data/ is deliberately NOT ignored.
# The frozen SPY dataset and its quality log are research artifacts.
# the reproducibility claim in the methodology depends on versioning the
# exact snapshot used. The files are small (a few hundred KB).

# The final results are versioned so reviewers can inspect the exact evidence
# used in the thesis and compare it with a fresh run.
